## WORD CHOICES

### Preferred Terms

| Concept | Use | Don't Use |
|---------|-----|-----------|
| Screen time impact | Static, Noise, Interference | Debt, Damage, Harm |
| Reducing static | Clearing, Cleaning, Restoring | Paying back, Making up |
| Good state | Clarity, Signal, Presence | Healthy, Clean, Sober |
| Progress | Strengthening, Improving | Winning, Succeeding |
| Setback | Drifting, Scattering | Failing, Relapsing |
| User | You | Addict, User (clinical) |
| Actions | Actions, Tools | Tasks, Exercises |
| Difficulty | Challenge | Hard, Difficult |

### Forbidden Words

**Never use these words:**
- Addict / Addiction (use "pattern" or "habit")
- Debt / Owe
- Penalty / Punishment / Consequence
- Failed / Failure
- Relapse
- Should / Must / Need to
- Guilty / Shame
- Weak / Strong
- Good / Bad (for days or behavior)
- Perfect / Streak-breaking

