## CONTEXTUAL MESSAGING

### Time of Day

| Time | Tone | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Morning | Gentle activation | "Your morning is yours." |
| Afternoon | Grounding | "Midday check-in." |
| Evening | Wind-down | "Evening is for settling." |
| Night | Quiet, permission | "It's late. Rest is allowed." |

### Static Level + Time Combinations

| Scenario | Message |
|----------|---------|
| High static, morning | "Start fresh. Clear what accumulated overnight." |
| High static, night | "Your signal is heavy. Tomorrow is a new day." |
| Low static, morning | "Clear signal. Good conditions for today." |
| Low static, night | "You kept your signal clear. Rest well." |

