### Network Issues

```
"Exit works offline. Your progress is saved."
[Continue]
```

### Permission Needed

```
"Exit needs Screen Time access to understand your patterns."
[Open Settings]
```

### Generic Error

```
"Something went wrong. We'll try again."
[Okay]
```

