| Element | Max Length |
|---------|------------|
| Static insight | 60 characters |
| Notification | 50 characters |
| Button label | 25 characters |
| Quest name | 30 characters |
| Quest intent | 40 characters |
| Action title | 20 characters |
| Error message | 60 characters |

---

## PUNCTUATION RULES

- **Periods:** Use for complete sentences, even short ones
- **Exclamation points:** Never (except rare celebration)
- **Question marks:** Use for pattern break prompts
- **Ellipses:** Avoid (suggests trailing off)
- **Emoji:** Never in core UI (only action icons)

---

## LOCALIZATION NOTES

When translating to other languages:

1. **Preserve tone:** Calm > grammatically perfect
2. **Preserve brevity:** Short > comprehensive
3. **Preserve warmth:** Human > formal
4. **Test with native speakers:** Does it feel calming?

